  "description": "Ji-Won just wants to enjoy a steamy one-night stand, but the neighbor from hell keeps killing the mood. After nights of listening to a heartbroken stranger wail breakup anthems through the walls, Ji-Won finally storms next door to demand silence. Instead of a typical nuisance, he finds Hyeon watching a cringey, viral video of Ji-Won’s most cringe college memory. Now that his secret \"black history\" is out, things are about to get a lot more sour - and a little bit spicy.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
